  "description": "Adamantium UI: a .NET UI framework for desktop applications on its own Vulkan renderer - controls up to docking, a ribbon, a tree data grid and an infinite canvas; AUML markup compiled to C#; styles and live themes; MVVM and navigation; and a 3D scene as an element of the markup. The package to reference: it brings the controls, the themes, the AUML code generator and MVVM with its generator.",
